    "body": "## Summary\n\nADR-031 Commit 1: float v1 (block-level float + block narrowing) + .sidebar hide. **Draft PR** - known paint-overlap bug flagged; merging depends on whether the next ADR (paint culling) can fix it.\n\n## Measured layout tree (viewport 1774)\n\n| Element | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| .infobox x | 324 (inline list) | **914** (right edge) |\n| .infobox width | 1398 (full content) | **358** (22em) |\n| First p x | 324 | 324 |\n| First p width | 1398 | **590** (narrowed beside infobox) |\n| mw-content-container height | 54000 (pre-ADR-031) | 61923 |\n\n## Known bug: paint-level overlap\n\nInfobox layout is correct (x=914 y=497 w=358 h=781, children inside bounds). But the rendered PNG shows infobox content at BOTH x=914 (correct) AND x=324 (leaked). Same text appears in both columns.\n\n**Two candidate causes, both deferred to next ADR:**\n1. Paint culling - a display:none subtree being rendered by paint despite layout skipping it\n2. shift_subtree_x recursion - a LayoutKind variant missing the shift, leaving fragments at pre-shift x\n\n**Draft status:** merging puts a visible regression on main. Next ADR picks this up. If it fixes the overlap, both merge. If not, this reverts and float defers.\n\n## What landed correctly\n\n- shift_subtree_x in grid_layout.{hpp,cpp}\n- Float parsing + block-level layout in layout_block_children\n- Narrowing uses cursor_y + margin_top (not just cursor_y)\n- .sidebar{display:none !important} in desktop viewport_css\n- 9 tests in [layout][float][adr-031]\n\n## Stray-</html> misreading\n\nDiagnostic confirms no stray closing-tag bug:\n- DOM: two legitimate <!DOCTYPE html> code samples (article body, y~7815)\n- Source: one document-level </html> at byte 799540\n- UA stylesheet hides head/script/style/title/meta/link/base/template\n\nNo fix needed. In ADR-031's record.\n\n## Test count\n\n- Before: 399 / 1660\n- After: **408 / 1692** (+9 / +32)\n- Full suite all pass, zero warnings\n\n## After merge or revert\n\n- If next ADR fixes overlap: rerun /tmp/dup_check, confirm infobox only at x=914, PNG clean\n- If not: revert this commit, ADR-031 status stays Accepted with Implementation noting \"float v1 box-level correct; paint overlap; per-line wrap + paint culling required\"\n\nRefs #169\n",
